      "canonical_latex": "D_n(E) = \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^3}\\iint_{E_n(\\mathbf{k})=E} \\frac{dS_{\\mathbf{k}}}{|\\nabla_{\\mathbf{k}} E_n(\\mathbf{k})|} = \\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^3}\\iint_{E_n(\\mathbf{k})=E} \\frac{dS_{\\mathbf{k}}}{\\hbar|\\mathbf{v}_n(\\mathbf{k})|}",
